<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Model Configuratons</h3>

<section id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">MineWorld</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We apply the proposed algorithm and post-train three MineWorld models of different sizes—300M, 700M, and 1.2B parameters—based on the LLaMA architecture. The base model configurations are summarized in Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ MineWorld ‣ A.2 Model Configuratons ‣ Appendix A More Implementation Details ‣ Reinforcement Learning with Inverse Rewards for World Model Post-training" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>The configuration of different size of MineWorld models.</figcaption>
