</section>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Experimental Settings</h3>

<section id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">MineWorld</h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ MineWorld ‣ A.3 Experimental Settings ‣ Appendix A More Implementation Details ‣ Reinforcement Learning with Inverse Rewards for World Model Post-training" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> lists the hyperparameters used for MineWorld post-training.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Hyper-parameters for MineWorld.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T6.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T6.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hyperparameter</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T6.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Value</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Learning rate scheduler</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">cosine</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r">Learning rate</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.T6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3e^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3e^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
