<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>More Visualization Results</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present additional visualization cases in Figure <a href="#A3.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ Appendix C More Visualization Results ‣ Reinforcement Learning with Inverse Rewards for World Model Post-training" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>: the first three cases are from NFD, and the last case is from MineWorld. More videos can be found in the supplementary material.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.F6" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.23958v1/appendix_case.png" id="A3.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:548/575;" width="548" height="575" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>More Qualitative results. The top row displays the baseline output, and the bottom row is the output after post-training.</figcaption>
</figure>
